  "sourceTitle": "Basic Cookie Recipe",
  "sourceText": "Basic Cookie Recipe\nBy: Andie Mitchell\nPublished: Sunday, December 20, 2009 - 12:26am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 cup brown sugar, packed\n1 cup granulated sugar\n2 1/2 cups self-rising flour\n2 sticks butter\n2 eggs\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Cream sugar, butter and eggs together. Add flour to creamed mixture and mix well. Bake at 350 degrees for 15 to 18 minutes.\n\nAbout\n\n\nVariations: Add to above mixture--chocolate chips, nuts, peanut butter chips, coconut, etc...",
